- More efficient parallelization:
    - Adaptive chunking
        1. Memorize the time spent for each task chunk and each node.
        2. Dynamically change the chunk-size per node depending on the parameter
        3. Very difficult to implement: how to measure/chunk the task?
    - Dynamic work distribution
        1. Relatively simple to implement
        2. Master node still has too large responsibility
        3. Obstacles: 
            master node may not respond while running simulations
            asyncronized programming needed
    - Work stealing algorithm
        1. Master node does not distribute: workers steal from master
        2. Obstacles: 
            master node may not respond while running simulations
            asyncronized programming needed


